### Health check (AgentCore /ping contract)
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### List available specialist agents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents

### Process an invoice (text, explicit agent) via the AgentCore contract endpoint
POST http://localhost:8080/invocations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amzn-Bedrock-AgentCore-Runtime-Session-Id: batch-1

{
  "agentType": "INVOICE",
  "question": "Is the math correct and who is the vendor?",
  "content": "INVOICE\nInvoice Number: INV-2026-00841\nVendor: Globex\nSubtotal: 6500.00\nTax (8%): 520.00\nTotal: 7020.00\nDue Date: 2026-06-11"
}

### Process an UNSIGNED check — should trigger the 'check-missing-signature' ALERT
POST http://localhost:8080/invocations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amzn-Bedrock-AgentCore-Runtime-Session-Id: batch-1

{
  "agentType": "BANK_CHECK",
  "content": "FIRST NATIONAL BANK Check No. 1043\nDate: 2026-05-20\nPay to the order of: Acme Corp $1,250.00\nOne thousand two hundred fifty and 00/100 DOLLARS\nSignature: (left blank)"
}

### Auto-classify (no agentType) and answer a question
POST http://localhost:8080/invocations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amzn-Bedrock-AgentCore-Runtime-Session-Id: batch-1

{
  "question": "What kind of document is this and what is the total?",
  "content": "INVOICE\nInvoice Number: INV-2026-00841\nTotal: 7020.00 USD"
}

### Interactive file upload: choose agent + attach a file (multipart)
# Most editors support file refs in .http files; otherwise use the curl form in the README.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----idp

------idp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="agentType"

BANK_CHECK
------idp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="question"

Is this check signed?
------idp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="check-unsigned.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./samples/check-unsigned.txt
------idp--

### Prometheus metrics (idp.documents.processed, idp.extraction.confidence, idp.alerts.sent)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
